    "title": "Great Spook Tree",
    "pageid": 101325,
    "revid": 855008,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png/64px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png?7e1dc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png/128px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Head.png?7e1dc 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>Great Spook Exclusive</b><br />\n<b>Great Spook Tree</b> is only available during <a href=\"/w/The_Great_Spook\" title=\"The Great Spook\">The Great Spook</a>, when the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Tyashoi Alchemist in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/16px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png/32px-Tyashoi_Alchemist_Sprite.png?a6f7a 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"288\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Tyashoi_Alchemist\" title=\"Tyashoi Alchemist\">Tyashoi Alchemist</a> is present in the <a href=\"/w/Farm\" title=\"Farm\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-yellow\" style=\"\">Farm</span></a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">Great Spook Tree</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Great_Spook_Tree.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Great Spook Tree.png\"><img alt=\"Great Spook Tree.png\" src=\"/images/Great_Spook_Tree.png?b01de\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mcui-row\"><span class=\"invslot\"><span class=\"invslot-item invslot-item-image\" data-minetip-style=\"epic\" data-minetip-title=\"&amp;5Great Spook Tree\" data-minetip-text=\"&amp;7Place this item on your island!//&amp;7Place ONE of this tree on your island,/&amp;7and collect its &amp;5fruits&amp;7... rarely.//&amp;5&amp;lEPIC\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Great Spook Tree\"><img alt=\"Great Spook Tree.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Great_Spook_Tree.png/32px-Great_Spook_Tree.png?b01de\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Great_Spook_Tree.png/64px-Great_Spook_Tree.png?b01de 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nItem</div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Rarity</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Source </div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Vargul the Unearthed in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/16px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/32px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\">Vargul the Unearthed</a></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Obtained </div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\nThe <a href=\"/w/Great_Spook\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Spook\">Great Spook</a></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Properties</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be sold to an NPC. If an item is not salable but has enchantments on it, it becomes salable.\" tabindex=\"0\">Salable</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Tradeable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Auctionable</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">✔</span></span> <span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><b>Yes</b></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\"><abbr title=\"Whether or not the item(s) can be donated to the Museum\" tabindex=\"0\">Museum</abbr></div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">✕</span></span> <span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\"><b>No</b></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Shop</div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Merchants</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<ul style=\"line-height:inherit;margin-top:0;list-style-type:none;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0\"><li style=\"margin-left: 0;margin-bottom: 0;padding-bottom: 0;text-align:center;\"><span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Vargul the Unearthed in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/16px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/32px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\">Vargul the Unearthed</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Buy</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Dark_Candy\" title=\"Dark Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Dark_Candy.png/21px-Dark_Candy.png?89eba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dark_Candy.png/42px-Dark_Candy.png?89eba 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><abbr title=\"2 stacks plus 42\" tabindex=\"0\">170</abbr></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Dark_Candy\" title=\"Dark Candy\">Dark Candy</a></div></div></div><div class=\"group layout-horizontal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Auction House <span style=\"text-decoration:underline dashed\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://sky.coflnet.com/item/SPOOKY_TREE\">Prices</a></span></span><b><sup><abbr class=\"auction-house-info-icon auction-house-info-icon-no-time\" title=\"Values are updated every 15 minutes from Hypixel&#39;s API.\">ⓘ</abbr></sup></b></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Latest)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiY3VycmVudCIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IlNQT09LWV9UUkVFIn0=\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Daily Average)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYXZlcmFnZSIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IlNQT09LWV9UUkVFIn0=\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>SPOOKY_TREE</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Great Spook Tree</b> is an <span data-sort-value=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Epic\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-dark&#95;purple\" style=\"\">EPIC</span></span></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Furniture\" title=\"Furniture\">Furniture</a> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Game_Message\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Game Message</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>A <b>Great Spook Tree</b> can be purchased from <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Vargul the Unearthed in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/16px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Zombie_Sprite.png/32px-Zombie_Sprite.png?b5fd5 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Vargul_the_Unearthed\" title=\"Vargul the Unearthed\">Vargul the Unearthed</a> in <a href=\"/w/Unincorporated\" title=\"Unincorporated\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-red\" style=\"\">Unincorporated</span></a> for <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Dark_Candy\" title=\"Dark Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Dark_Candy.png/21px-Dark_Candy.png?89eba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Dark_Candy.png/42px-Dark_Candy.png?89eba 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\"><abbr title=\"2 stacks plus 42\" tabindex=\"0\">170</abbr></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Dark_Candy\" title=\"Dark Candy\">Dark Candy</a> during the <a href=\"/w/Great_Spook\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Great Spook\">Great Spook</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>When placed on the <a href=\"/w/Private_Island\" title=\"Private Island\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-green\" style=\"\">Private Island</span></a>, the <b>Great Spook Tree</b> has a <span class=\"light-color color-green\">10%</span> chance to generate <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/21px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/42px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\">Green Candy</a> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">85%</span>) or <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/21px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/42px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\">Purple Candy</a> (<span class=\"light-color color-green\">15%</span>) at 12:00 AM <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Time\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SkyBlock Time\">SkyBlock Time</a> after <span class=\"light-color color-green\">30</span> <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Day\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SkyBlock Day\">SkyBlock Days</a> (10 Hours) since candy was last generated. Candy is guaranteed to generate after <span class=\"light-color color-green\">42</span> <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Day\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"SkyBlock Day\">SkyBlock Days</a> (14 Hours). Only a total of <span class=\"light-color color-green\">5</span> <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/21px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/42px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\">Green Candy</a> and <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/21px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/42px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\">Purple Candy</a> can be held at once.\n</p><p>Only one <b>Great Spook Tree</b> can be placed at a time. It can be picked up again by Left-Clicking it.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Game_Message\">Game Message</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Game Message\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Game Message\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Guaranteed Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Taking <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/21px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Green_Candy.png/42px-Green_Candy.png?e15ab 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Green_Candy\" title=\"Green Candy\">Green Candy</a>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\">You got </span><span class=\"format-a\">&lt;amount&gt; Green Candy </span><span class=\"format-6\">from the </span><span class=\"format-5\">Great Spook Tree</span><span class=\"format-6\">!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Taking <span class=\"spriteicon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/21px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Purple_Candy.png/42px-Purple_Candy.png?bd5c3 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/w/Purple_Candy\" title=\"Purple Candy\">Purple Candy</a>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-6\">You got </span><span class=\"format-5\">&lt;amount&gt; Purple Candy </span><span class=\"format-6\">from the </span><span class=\"format-5\">Great Spook Tree</span><span class=\"format-6\">!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">No candy generated\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">I don't have any candy for you right now! Go away! &gt;:(</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Candy generated while on the island\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-a\">Your </span><span class=\"format-5\">Great Spook Tree </span><span class=\"format-a\">has just sprouted a fruit!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Interacting with a <b>Great Spook Tree</b> while guesting\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">HEY! I don't belong to you &gt;:(</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Great_Spook_Tree?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 135px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 130px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Great_Spook_Tree_Render.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Great_Spoo